{"unit_id":"cxv117793-blip__dsh-step-pause#card-en","repo":"cxv117793-blip/dsh-step-pause","commit":"4b30e4ae79de94f83678ece2e48fc292816ead7a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-step-pause adds progress checkpoints to DSH web agent turns. At a configured interval, it asks for current work, completed items, next action, and blockers, then continues. Users can set report limits, prompt visibility, and main-agent-only mode. Settings appear in the plugin page and sidebar.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:72-89","lib/index.js:91-131","lib/index.js:845-899","lib/index.js:941-960","lib/client.js:615-671"]}
