{"unit_id":"cxv117793-blip__dsh-step-pause#caveat-1","repo":"cxv117793-blip/dsh-step-pause","commit":"4b30e4ae79de94f83678ece2e48fc292816ead7a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-step-pause 使用前须知：检查点提示以 role 为 user 的消息加入当前输入批次，并可能保留在会话历史中；showPromptInChat 默认隐藏的是显示层提示原文，不代表模型收不到该消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-15","lib/index.js:164-165","lib/index.js:896-899"]}
